#: configdialog.cpp:92
msgid "&Popup menu at mouse-cursor position"
msgstr "Opspring kieslys na mouse-cursor posisie"

#: configdialog.cpp:94
msgid "Save clipboard contents on e&xit"
msgstr "Stoor klipbord inhoud op beïendig"

#: configdialog.cpp:96
msgid "Remove whitespace when executing actions"
msgstr ""

#: configdialog.cpp:98
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the selected text has some whitespace at the end, which, if "
"loaded as URL in a browser would cause an error. Enabling this option "
"removes any whitespace at the beginning or end of the selected string (the "
"original clipboard contents will not be modified)."
msgstr ""

#: configdialog.cpp:100
msgid "&Replay actions on an item selected from history"
msgstr "Weerspeel aksies op 'n item gekose van geskiedenis"

#: configdialog.cpp:103
msgid "Pre&vent empty clipboard"
msgstr "Verhoed leeg klipbord"

#: configdialog.cpp:105
msgid ""
"Selecting this option has the effect, that the clipboard can never be "
"emptied. E.g. when an application exits, the clipboard would usually be "
"emptied."
msgstr ""
"Deur te kies hierdie opsie het die effek, wat die klipbord kan moet nooit "
"wees leeg gemaak word nie. E.g. wanneer 'n aansoek uitgaan, die klipbord sal "
"gewoonlik wees leeg gemaak word nie."

#: configdialog.cpp:110
msgid "&Ignore selection"
msgstr "Ignoreer keuse"

#: configdialog.cpp:112
msgid ""
"This option prevents the selection being recorded in the clipboard history. "
"Only explicit clipboard changes are recorded."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie voorkom die keuse te wees opgeneem in die klipbord "
"geskiedenis. Slegs eksplisiet klipbord verander word opgeneem."

#: configdialog.cpp:116
msgid "Clipboard/Selection Behavior"
msgstr "Klipbord/Keuse Gedrag"

#: configdialog.cpp:120
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<qt>There are two different clipboard buffers "
"available:"
"<br>"
"<br><b>Clipboard</b> is filled by selecting something and pressing Ctrl+C, "
"or by clicking \"Copy\" in a toolbar or menubar."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Selection</b>"
" is available immediately after selecting some text. The only way to access "
"the selection is to press the middle mouse button."
"<br>"
"<br>You can configure the relationship between Clipboard and Selection.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Daar word twee ander klipbord buffers beskikbaar:"
"<br>"
"<br><b>klipbord</b> is gevul deur deur te kies iets"
"<br>en gedruk Ctrl+C, of deur te kliek \"Kopie\" in 'n nutsbalk "
"of"
"<br>kiesbalk."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Keuse</b> is beskikbaar dadelik na"
"<br>deur te kies sommige teks. Die slegs weg na toegang verkry Die "
"Keuse"
"<br>is na druk Die middelste muis knoppie."
"<br><br>Jy kan konfigureer Die verhouding tussen klipbord en Keuse.</qt>"

#: configdialog.cpp:131
msgid "Sy&nchronize contents of the clipboard and the selection"
msgstr "Sinkroniseer inhoud van die klipbord en die keuse"

#: configdialog.cpp:134
msgid ""
"Selecting this option synchronizes these two buffers, so they work the same "
"way as in KDE 1.x and 2.x."
msgstr ""
"Deur te kies hierdie opsie sinkroniseer hierdie twee buffers, sodat hulle "
"werk die selfde weg as in Kde 1.x en 2.x."

#: configdialog.cpp:138
msgid "Separate clipboard and selection"
msgstr "Aparte klipbord en keuse"

#: configdialog.cpp:141
msgid ""
"Using this option will only set the selection when highlighting something "
"and the clipboard when choosing e.g. \"Copy\" in a menubar."
msgstr ""
"Te gebruik hierdie opsie sal slegs stel die keuse wanneer verligting iets en "
"die klipbord wanneer kies e.g. \"Kopie\" in 'n kiesbalk."

#: configdialog.cpp:149
msgid "Tim&eout for action popups:"
msgstr "Tydverstreke vir aksie opspring:"

#: configdialog.cpp:151
msgid " sec"
msgstr " sek"

#: configdialog.cpp:152
msgid "A value of 0 disables the timeout"
msgstr "'n waarde van 0 deaktiveer die tydverstreke"

